---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="CELPIP Lessons — IELTS Corner"
  description="CELPIP-only lessons for Listening, Reading, Speaking, and Writing. CLB 7-8 focused and strategy-based."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="hero" style={`--hero-bg: url('/heroes/lesson.png');`}>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="pill">🍁 CELPIP Lessons</span>

        <h1>Pick a skill. Train it properly.</h1>

        <p class="muted" style="max-width: 58ch;">
          These are CELPIP-only lessons. Simple systems, clear structure, and practice that targets CLB 7+ weaknesses.
        </p>

        <div class="cluster">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons">← Back to Lessons hub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/webinar">Webinars →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Listening</h3>
        <p class="muted">Train rapid listening comprehension, note-taking strategies, and real-world conversation accuracy.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons/celpip/listening">Open →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Reading</h3>
        <p class="muted">Learn efficient scanning, inference skills, and how to answer questions on academic and professional texts.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons/celpip/reading">Open →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Speaking</h3>
        <p class="muted">Master the eight speaking tasks with clear strategies, natural pacing, and coherent explanations.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons/celpip/speaking">Open →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <h3>Writing</h3>
        <p class="muted">Practice two writing tasks: email writing and survey responses with clear structure and professional tone.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons/celpip/writing">Open →</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <div class="surface feature">
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="stack">
          <h2>Want live training?</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="max-width: 58ch;">
            Lessons help you understand the system — but live webinars give you real-time feedback and strategy guidance.
          </p>
          <div class="cluster">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/webinar">See webinars →</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/tutoring">One-on-one tutoring →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
